WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.130
Adverbs can show how an action occurs and help make a narrative exact, when they add

00:00:05.130 --> 00:00:05.747
useful meaning.

00:00:06.617 --> 00:00:11.718
Complete the report: “Ama offered her seat blank .” Choose an adverb that tells how.

00:00:11.718 --> 00:00:12.398
Answer: kindly

00:00:13.200 --> 00:00:17.936
Revise dull verbs with accurate action details and selective adverbs of manner.

00:00:18.783 --> 00:00:22.815
Kindly is an adverb of manner; it describes how the action happens.
